  "content": "<h1>礦脈附魔</h1><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&amp;color=blue&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-veinminer-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ly-veinminer-enchantment?label=modrinth&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"授權\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-ff5f5f?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"贊助\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/paypal-donate-ff5f5f?logo=paypal&amp;color=blue\" alt=\"贊助\"></a></p><hr><h2>📖 說明</h2><p>為鎬子新增的新附魔，可以一次挖掘多個相連的相同礦物（僅限原版鎬子和原版礦物）！</p><p>與幸運和絲綢之觸相容！</p><p>與流行的礦脈礦工資料包有何不同？差異如下：</p><ul>\n<li>更好的效能。</li>\n<li>無需其他資料包即可運作。</li>\n<li>每開採一個額外方塊，鎬子都會受到耐久損耗。</li>\n<li>若你開採的方塊會提供經驗值，則其他方塊也會提供。</li>\n<li>與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsmelting-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">熔煉</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmagnetic-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">磁力</a>附魔相容！</li>\n</ul><p>此附魔可從附魔台、戰利品箱或與村民交易獲得。</p><hr><h2>⚠️ 不相容</h2><p>與以下項目不相容：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconfigurable-despawn-timer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可設定消失計時器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a></li>\n</ul><hr><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>⌨️ 指令</h2><p>給予:</p><pre><code>/loot give @s loot veinminer_enchantment:veinminer</code></pre><p>附魔:</p><pre><code>/enchant @s veinminer_enchantment:veinminer</code></pre><hr><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>🪪 授權</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p><hr><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>👾 錯誤/問題</h2><p>請在<a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>中回報任何問題/錯誤/Bug。</p><hr><h2>💌 捐款贊助</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 上贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 上贊助</a></li>\n</ul><hr><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器託管\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p><p>建立自己的伺服器可能是一個非常漫長、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p><p>但有了 BisectHosting，只需點擊幾下就能擁有自己的伺服器！憑藉他們全天候的支援和快速回應，沒有什麼問題能難倒你！有興趣嗎？我們為你準備了一個優惠方案！</p>",
